	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/graphics/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Classic draws as the Xbox did; Enhanced turns on\nthe improvements below. Each can still be changed."/>
		<string text="Draw the HUD from the high-res redraws; off\ndraws the game's own pictures."/>
		<string text="Classic: plain Xbox buttons. Gems: shaded Xbox\nbuttons. Dark Gems: the menu's button artwork."/>
		<string text="Draw text and titles with high-res fonts; off\ndraws the game's own."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges. FXAA and SMAA cost little;\nSSAA and MSAA are sharper and cost more."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges. FXAA and SMAA cost little;\nMSAA is sharper and costs more."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges. FXAA costs little; MSAA is\nsharper and costs more."/>
		<string text="Keep floors and walls sharp into the distance.\nOff looks as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text="How smooth the edges of objects' shadows are:\nXBOX as the original; higher costs more."/>
		<string text="Light characters and weapons smoothly, without\nthe flat facets of the Xbox's lighting."/>
		<string text="Detail of models in the distance: Xbox as on a TV,\nFull for your screen. Auto: Full in VR."/>
		<string text="Enhanced: plasma bolts, muzzle flashes and blasts\nlight their surroundings smoothly, with a glow."/>
		<string text="Draw a clock at the bottom right in multiplayer,\ncounting up from the start of the game."/>
		<string text="How often the world updates. 60 and 120 respond\nfaster; online games always play at 30."/>
	</strings>
